<title>UK: LME copper ends PM kerb slightly firmer, off high.</title>
<headline>LME copper ends PM kerb slightly firmer, off high.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Ends PM kerb slightly firmer at $2,319 but off highs. Cash/threes backwardation touch wider from Friday at $142/$157.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Barely firmer, also off earlier peak.</p>
<p>ZINC - Ends slightly higher, off fresh seven-year highs.</p>
<p>LEAD - Little changed. TIN - Touches fresh 2-1/3 year lows.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Slightly firmer, but rangebound.</p>
</text>
